cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  research — open reading notes on machine learning, reinforcement learning and
  neuroscience
message: >-
  If a note here informed your work, cite the collection with this entry and
  link the individual note by its page URL.
abstract: >-
  A collection of open reading notes and essays on machine learning,
  reinforcement learning, deep learning, neuroscience and meta-research. Each
  note separates what a paper claims from what its evidence supports, and
  declares the sources it rests on in machine-checkable front matter.
authors:
